  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>When you&#39;re creating a VM in your lab, you can now select a Kali Linux image. After you enable this image, it will appear in the list of available images at VM creation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/blog/193d97d9-a46f-49e3-b9f0-1fba3693a917.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/blog/8a8ceeab-c42a-421a-81c4-7b32120b4e38.png\" title=\"image\"></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>As a lab owner, you need to review and accept the terms of use for this image in order to enable it for the users of your lab.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/blog/d48d0c14-7d62-4e98-80cd-e861eda8342f.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/blog/ff1f3296-4105-4096-8163-d74a30db8199.png\" title=\"image\"></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/blog/3de5228b-de0d-4489-9715-3426a376343d.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/blog/b8cf3ded-db2f-4c5b-9077-7f2884d03e80.png\" title=\"image\"></a></p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "When you're creating a VM in your lab, you can now select a Kali Linux image. After you enable this image, it will appear in the list of available images at VM creation.\n\nAs a lab owner, you need to review and accept the terms of use for this image in order to enable it for the users of your lab."
  },
